       "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒎</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑩</mi></mrow></math>"
